{"sessions": "4", "seconds": 300.0, "legs": {"call06_agent": {"name": "call06_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_hm1r8avi0uv9mu2e", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.22, "commit_t": 6.6, "transcript": "您好，Zentra 客服中心，很高兴为您服务，请问有什么可以帮您？", "latency_ms": 308.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.36, "commit_t": 11.9, "transcript": "请问是机主本人在使用吗？", "latency_ms": 225.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 16.44, "commit_t": 21.7, "transcript": "为了保障您的账户安全，需要核实一下您的身份，请问您的姓氏是？", "latency_ms": 281.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 38.16, "commit_t": 40.0, "transcript": "好的，不着急。", "latency_ms": 170.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 40.14, "commit_t": 46.6, "transcript": "如果升级以后还是不行，您把手机型号告诉我，我帮您核对是否支持。", "latency_ms": 320.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 52.76, "commit_t": 59.0, "transcript": "太好了，激活以后实体卡会自动停用，请您确认手机信号是不是正常。", "latency_ms": 346.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 66.34, "commit_t": 73.3, "transcript": "这个型号是支持的，我先帮您把二维码重新发送到您的邮箱，您可以直接在手机上打开。", "latency_ms": 326.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 74.32, "commit_t": 75.7, "transcript": "收到。", "latency_ms": 190.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 79.82, "commit_t": 84.3, "transcript": "在 App 的 Easy A 网页的按钮点击生成。", "latency_ms": 279.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 84.34, "commit_t": 86.9, "transcript": "二维码有效期是半小时。", "latency_ms": 212.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 86.94, "commit_t": 89.3, "transcript": "国旗需要重新生成。", "latency_ms": 192.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 95.74, "commit_t": 103.1, "transcript": "请您检查一下手机系统是不是最新版本，有的机型需要先做一次 OTA 升级才能识别。", "latency_ms": 326.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 109.28, "commit_t": 116.1, "transcript": "您需要准备身份证，并保证手机连着 WiFi，因为开通过程中会下载一个二维码配置。", "latency_ms": 294.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 121.8, "commit_t": 127.5, "transcript": "可以的，您可以在 App 里选择号码转 eSIM，不需要去营业厅。", "latency_ms": 310.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 128.42, "commit_t": 129.3, "transcript": "好的。", "latency_ms": 175.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 129.48, "commit_t": 132.0, "transcript": "我这边需要查询一下系统。", "latency_ms": 152.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 132.22, "commit_t": 135.6, "transcript": "大约需要一分钟，请您在线等待。", "latency_ms": 212.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 177.3, "commit_t": 180.6, "transcript": "谢谢您的耐心等待，我这边查到结果了。", "latency_ms": 233.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 192.36, "commit_t": 193.6, "transcript": "好的。", "latency_ms": 184.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 193.72, "commit_t": 196.0, "transcript": "还有什么需要帮助的吗？", "latency_ms": 161.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 202.32, "commit_t": 209.8, "transcript": "好的，请稍等，我帮您查询一下。我看到包裹昨天到达了您所在城市的分拨中心。", "latency_ms": 353.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 214.62, "commit_t": 216.8, "transcript": "最近快递量比较大。", "latency_ms": 165.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 216.8, "commit_t": 219.2, "transcript": "可能会延迟一天。", "latency_ms": 158.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 219.76, "commit_t": 222.4, "transcript": "预计明天下午会安排派送。", "latency_ms": 184.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 228.4, "commit_t": 234.3, "transcript": "同城修改地址一般不会影响时效，改好以后我会给您发一条确认短信。", "latency_ms": 293.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 240.72, "commit_t": 246.8, "transcript": "可以的，包裹还没有派送，我可以帮您修改，请您告诉我新的详细地址。", "latency_ms": 299.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 27, "speech_t": 247.42, "commit_t": 249.2, "transcript": "", "latency_ms": 43.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 28, "speech_t": 255.04, "commit_t": 260.5, "transcript": "好的，您可以直接回复订单短信，我这边收到以后会立刻处理。", "latency_ms": 269.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 29, "speech_t": 269.94, "commit_t": 272.8, "transcript": "今天的问题是否已经为您解决了？", "latency_ms": 187.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 30, "speech_t": 276.46, "commit_t": 279.7, "transcript": "感谢您的来电，祝您生活愉快，再见。", "latency_ms": 223.0, "failed": null}]}, "call06_customer": {"name": "call06_customer", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_ad2fw0yxg8h4mrnd", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 7.02, "commit_t": 8.8, "transcript": "喂，你好。", "latency_ms": 193.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 12.74, "commit_t": 13.6, "transcript": "呃。", "latency_ms": 175.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 13.84, "commit_t": 15.7, "transcript": "对，是我本人。", "latency_ms": 366.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 23.06, "commit_t": 24.6, "transcript": "我姓王。", "latency_ms": 217.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 25.28, "commit_t": 27.0, "transcript": "你好。", "latency_ms": 191.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 27.0, "commit_t": 33.1, "transcript": "我新买了手机，想开通翼载，应该怎么操作？", "latency_ms": 230.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 33.58, "commit_t": 36.8, "transcript": "我现在去升级，等一下再打给你们。", "latency_ms": 235.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 48.52, "commit_t": 49.7, "transcript": "收到了。", "latency_ms": 181.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 49.8, "commit_t": 51.2, "transcript": "好像可以了。", "latency_ms": 150.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 60.18, "commit_t": 64.5, "transcript": "手机型号是 NovaNet Max 配套的那款。", "latency_ms": 245.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 77.02, "commit_t": 79.0, "transcript": "二维码在哪里看？", "latency_ms": 160.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 90.24, "commit_t": 91.5, "transcript": "我扫了。", "latency_ms": 189.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 91.54, "commit_t": 95.1, "transcript": "但是手机提示无法添加。", "latency_ms": 170.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 104.56, "commit_t": 107.6, "transcript": "需要准备什么吗？", "latency_ms": 212.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 117.14, "commit_t": 120.9, "transcript": "我现在用的是实体 SIM 卡。", "latency_ms": 235.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 135.78, "commit_t": 176.6, "transcript": "", "latency_ms": 196.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 181.72, "commit_t": 185.4, "transcript": "你好，我在你们这里买的 Lumio 智能音箱。", "latency_ms": 249.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 185.44, "commit_t": 187.3, "transcript": "到现在还没有收到。", "latency_ms": 211.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 188.52, "commit_t": 189.4, "transcript": "", "latency_ms": 37.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 189.48, "commit_t": 191.3, "transcript": "那我等你们的短信。", "latency_ms": 199.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 197.36, "commit_t": 201.2, "transcript": "订单号是 T K 九三七二零。", "latency_ms": 230.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 211.14, "commit_t": 213.9, "transcript": "那为什么还没有送出来？", "latency_ms": 208.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 223.94, "commit_t": 226.7, "transcript": "改完以后会不会更慢？", "latency_ms": 220.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 236.06, "commit_t": 238.5, "transcript": "能不能改一下收货地址？", "latency_ms": 191.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 250.2, "commit_t": 254.3, "transcript": "改到我公司地址，我发短信给你们。", "latency_ms": 244.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 261.9, "commit_t": 262.8, "transcript": "喂。", "latency_ms": 140.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 27, "speech_t": 263.02, "commit_t": 265.9, "transcript": "我收到的 NovaNet Max 是坏的。", "latency_ms": 222.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 28, "speech_t": 266.18, "commit_t": 268.7, "transcript": "开不了机，怎么处理？", "latency_ms": 209.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 29, "speech_t": 273.56, "commit_t": 275.6, "transcript": "解决了，谢谢。", "latency_ms": 163.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 30, "speech_t": 280.22, "commit_t": 281.8, "transcript": "好的，再见。", "latency_ms": 153.4, "failed": null}]}, "call14_agent": {"name": "call14_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_uvfuh8u5kwjd3j07", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.22, "commit_t": 6.5, "transcript": "您好，Veltra，我是客服专员，请问您需要办理什么业务？", "latency_ms": 237.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.88, "commit_t": 12.4, "transcript": "请问您的手机号码是多少？", "latency_ms": 185.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 21.76, "commit_t": 27.1, "transcript": "为了保障您的账户安全，需要核实一下您的身份。请问您的姓氏是？", "latency_ms": 280.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 42.36, "commit_t": 45.9, "transcript": "这种情况可能是设备本身的故障。", "latency_ms": 208.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 45.98, "commit_t": 50.0, "transcript": "您还在七天无理由退换的时间内，可以选择换货。", "latency_ms": 244.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 57.26, "commit_t": 62.1, "transcript": "最快明天下午，快递员会提前一个小时给您打电话。", "latency_ms": 258.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 67.48, "commit_t": 71.3, "transcript": "质量问题造成的换货，运费全部由我们承担。", "latency_ms": 221.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 71.3, "commit_t": 73.4, "transcript": "您不需要支付任何费用。", "latency_ms": 167.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 78.88, "commit_t": 80.0, "transcript": "不需要。", "latency_ms": 150.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 80.0, "commit_t": 87.3, "transcript": "我们会安排快递员上门取件，同时寄出新的设备，您只需要在家等待就可以。", "latency_ms": 275.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 88.64, "commit_t": 90.4, "transcript": "", "latency_ms": 14.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 94.64, "commit_t": 101.7, "transcript": "好的，换货单已经生成，您会收到一条短信，里面有取件的详细信息。", "latency_ms": 334.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 109.34, "commit_t": 117.8, "transcript": "好的，我帮您创建换货单，单号是 SO 一五三五六零，请您保留好原来的包装。", "latency_ms": 369.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 121.88, "commit_t": 126.8, "transcript": "新设备会在取件以后的第二天发出，预计三天内送到。", "latency_ms": 278.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 130.92, "commit_t": 136.8, "transcript": "为了核对您的信息，请您用手机键盘输入八位服务码。", "latency_ms": 276.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 136.94, "commit_t": 139.6, "transcript": "完成后，按井号键。", "latency_ms": 211.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 155.7, "commit_t": 156.8, "transcript": "需要的。", "latency_ms": 181.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 157.04, "commit_t": 162.3, "transcript": "账号是您的宽带账号，密码在您开通的时候收到的短信里面。", "latency_ms": 256.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 167.32, "commit_t": 172.3, "transcript": "在直播的时候，按遥控器的左键就可以回看过去七天的节目。", "latency_ms": 308.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 179.56, "commit_t": 187.0, "transcript": "好的，那请您长按遥控器的设置键五秒，选择恢复出厂设置，看看能不能重新加载。", "latency_ms": 353.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 190.74, "commit_t": 191.7, "transcript": "好的。", "latency_ms": 204.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 191.8, "commit_t": 194.3, "transcript": "我这边需要查询一下系统。", "latency_ms": 211.1, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 194.54, "commit_t": 197.9, "transcript": "大约需要一分钟，请您在线等待。", "latency_ms": 194.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 267.82, "commit_t": 271.1, "transcript": "谢谢您的耐心等待，我这边查到结果了。", "latency_ms": 247.3, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 275.6, "commit_t": 280.8, "transcript": "没关系，我可以帮您重置密码，新密码会发到您的手机上。", "latency_ms": 301.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 286.98, "commit_t": 294.8, "transcript": "这种情况多半是网络连接异常，请您检查盒子的网线或者 WiFi 是否连接正常。", "latency_ms": 324.1, "failed": null}]}, "call14_customer": {"name": "call14_customer", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_scsttbxj1adgl9g2", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 6.94, "commit_t": 8.7, "transcript": "喂，你好。", "latency_ms": 188.4, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 14.4, "commit_t": 17.6, "transcript": "我的号码是，一三一七。", "latency_ms": 279.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 17.9, "commit_t": 19.3, "transcript": "零四四。", "latency_ms": 153.8, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 19.5, "commit_t": 21.1, "transcript": "一九六三。", "latency_ms": 159.5, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 28.38, "commit_t": 29.9, "transcript": "我姓王。", "latency_ms": 193.6, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 31.22, "commit_t": 32.2, "transcript": "喂。", "latency_ms": 137.0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 32.2, "commit_t": 34.9, "transcript": "我收到的 WiFi 6 是坏的。", "latency_ms": 215.2, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 34.96, "commit_t": 37.2, "transcript": "开不了机，怎么处理？", "latency_ms": 174.7, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 38.68, "commit_t": 41.8, "transcript": "通电以后，指示灯完全不亮。", "latency_ms": 238.9, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 51.42, "commit_t": 55.5, "transcript": "快递员什么时候来？", "latency_ms": 214.1, "fai